---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Field Expedition - April | Lake Titicaca (Puno) | Primigenias 33 Institute" description="The Cosmic Womb">
  <Header />

  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="page-header hero-bg-overlay" style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,14,0.7), var(--bg-dark)), url('/images/lago-titicaca.png');">
      <div class="container text-center scroll-reveal">
        <a href="/en/eventos-presenciales/" class="back-link">← Back to Annual Program</a>
        <h1 class="page-title text-gradient-flame" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Field Expedition - April | Lake Titicaca (Puno)</h1>
        <p class="lead">The Cosmic Womb</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container text-content-box glass-panel breathing-glow">
        
        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Climate & Season</h3>
          <p>Beginning of the dry season. The waters are serene and calm, the Andean shores gleam green after the rains, and horizon visibility is boundless.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-gold);">Brief Mystical History</h3>
          <p>Revered as the energetic heart of the Andean universe, Lake Titicaca is the primordial aquatic matrix from which sacred beings emerged to establish higher civilization. In Andean cosmovision, it is the universal cosmic womb (Mamacocha). From its holy waters, specifically from the Island of the Sun, Manco Cápac and Mama Ocllo emerged by decree of the Sun Father to illuminate humanity. It is acknowledged as one of the Earth's primary planetary chakras (associated with the sacral vortex of creative and transmutative energy), balancing masculine and feminine planetary polarities.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange);">Subjects of Work</h3>
          <p>Lake Titicaca embodies Zero Frequency: the realm of pure unmanifest potential. Floating upon its sacred waters and treading its holy islands, the student decodes their Birth Home (the primal environment that conditioned their psyche), ancestral cellular engrams, and initial tension point.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
          <a href="https://wa.me/51967747483" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Inquire Dates on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-main { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .page-header { padding: 5rem 1rem; text-align: center; background-position: center; background-size: cover; }
  .page-title { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .back-link { color: var(--accent-cyan); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
  .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .text-content-box { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: -3rem; position: relative; z-index: 10; text-align: left; }
  .detail-block { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .detail-block h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .detail-block p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
